'''Nyanko Daisensō ～Nippon Shinryaku Hiroku～''' (にゃんこ大戦争～日本侵略秘録～, lit. '''Nyanko Great War ~Secrets of the Japan Invasion~''') is a manga by Kazuo Ijūin, which ran from September 29th, 2015 to August 31st, 2019 on [https://ganma.jp/ GANMA!] Published every other week. 88 chapters in total.
As the title suggests, it is based on the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]] and depicts a war between the [[Cat Units|Cat]] army and the [[Enemy Units|enemy]] forces over [[Japan (Empire of Cats)|Japan]].
<br>
The protagonist of the manga is an original character, [[Nora (Special Cat)|Nora]].

''『にゃんこ』… <br>
それは謎に包まれた存在。 <br>
彼らの目的はただひとつ『日本侵略』 <br>
これは世に語られることのなかったにゃんこ達による戦争の記録！<br>
"Cats"...<br>
Entities shrouded in mystery.<br>
They have only one goal in mind: "to invade Japan" <br>
This is the story of a war by Cats that has never been told!''

